    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Plotting helpers (require matplotlib): log-linear salinity axes and isobaric T-X / H-X phase-region sections.

Moved unchanged from the former package __init__ (xThermal), except that plot_Pslice now creates its default model
when called instead of at import time. They are also available as xthermo.plot_Pslice etc. (imported on first use).
</verbatim> </para>
